{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cNo one saved OM. But Freg survived.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the alien race <strong>Katchazen</strong> annihilated his homeworld, <strong>Freg</strong> made a promise: no planet would ever fall again.<br>Armed with his ship and an unbreakable will, he now travels across distant solar systems, protecting worlds from destruction while searching for the truth behind the attack that started it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Freg is not alone.<br>In the shadows, the mysterious <strong>Organisers</strong> feed him cryptic coordinates and silent orders, always one step ahead, always watching. Their motives are unclear, and their reach stretches far beyond any single planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defenses, command advanced turrets, and pilot powerful ships in a blend of <strong>tower defense and space combat</strong>.<br>Every planet you save reveals new fragments of a galaxy-wide mystery, one that may force Freg to face not just his enemies, but the people he once called friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across five solar systems, from the red storms of <strong>ABADON</strong> to the deep oceans of <strong>NERO</strong>, your decisions will shape the future of the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect. Survive. Discover.</strong><br>Because sometimes, saving the universe means losing yourself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106760?t=1769197367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106760/ea0ccc877499c88826842b9c343ced0fd805451a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769197367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106760/da0c0a5df819366aee8125c843b05a406d178110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769197367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106760/da0c0a5df819366aee8125c843b05a40